        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The player assumes the role of Prince Theo whose father, King Hennessy has become corrupt and maniacal with power. He has enslaved the kingdom and exiled the great wisemen who once maintained the balance and prosperity of the kingdom. Theo's mother, Queen Remy, was killed by Hennessy but Theo was rescued from the castle without harm with the help of an old sage. Now that Theo has reached his teenage years and become a skilled warrior it is time for Theo to face his destiny and return to the castle where he was raised and defeat his father.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El jugador asume el papel del príncipe Theo, cuyo padre, el rey Hennessy, se ha corrompido y se ha vuelto maníaco con el poder. Ha esclavizado al reino y ha exiliado a los grandes sabios que antes mantenían el equilibrio y la prosperidad del reino. La reina Remy, madre de Theo, fue asesinada por Hennessy, pero Theo fue rescatado del castillo sin daño alguno con la ayuda de un viejo sabio. Ahora que Theo ha llegado a su adolescencia y se ha convertido en un guerrero hábil, es hora de que afronte su destino, regrese al castillo donde fue criado y derrote a su padre.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1989",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
