          "value": "This game is a dungeon crawling RPG. In it, you control a boy who woke up one day to find himself transformed into a cat. He learns that the royal heirloom of Cat Land has been stolen. He reluctantly goes on an adventure to retrieve it, as it is the only way to turn back.",
